        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Amagansett Handleset from the Classico Collection</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen Omnia designed their new Classico Collection, they decided to strive for over-the-top ornateness and the Amagansett Entryset is the epitome of their efforts. The fancy crest paired with the beautiful detailing on both the sides and the grip come together in a way that is truly stunning. It is available with your choice of interior trim--which are all works of art themselves. Choose from Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, and Venetian Nickel finishes--all of which are designed to highlight the beautiful details of both backplate and trim. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso See <a href=\"/products/omnia-classico-collection-amagansett-dummy-handleset\"><b>Omnia Classico Collection Amagansett Dummy Handleset</b></a> or the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=classico+collection\"><b>Complete Classico Collection</b></a> for matching knobs, levers, and deadbolts.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC1_size.gif?v=1704354673\" width=\"400\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classico Collection Amagansett Entry Handleset: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tough, non-rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" solid brass throw with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable armored steel front for beveled conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Amagansett Classico Collection Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Length: 21\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 13-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" high by 1-1/4\" wide with a 1-1/4\" lip to center. Finished to match trim. Dust box shipped with set.</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: Interior knob/lever, backplates, mortise latchset, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates.</li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-mortise-handleset-data-sheet.pdf?v=1704262251\" target=\"new\">Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function</b>:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Standard Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside,  thumbpiece outside except when outside is locked by rocker switch on mortise box; then opens by key outside, by lever or knob inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside.</li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside,  thumbpiece outside except when outside is locked by rocker switch on mortise box; then opens by key outside, by lever or knob inside.  Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside. Turning of inside knob or lever will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<!-- <li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside. The outside is operated by a thumbpiece. Deadbolt activated only by key on both the inside and the outside.</li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-DIVA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354622\" width=\"557\" height=\"103\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia AMAGANSETT Classico Collection Finish Options\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Omnia Classico Collection Amagansett Mortise Handleset",
                "description": "Omnia Classico Collection Amagansett Mortise Handleset - When Omnia designed their new Classico Collection, they decided to strive for over-the-top ornateness and the Amagansett Entryset is the epitome of their efforts. The fancy crest paired with the beautiful detailing on both the sides and the grip come together in a way that is truly stunning. It is available with your choice of interior trim--which are all works of art themselves. Choose from Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, and Venetian Nickel finishes--all of which are designed to highlight the beautiful details of both backplate and trim.",
